I cached the base-type index (avoiding a second `GetType()` call), hoisted the vector data pointer out of the loop, and replaced the byte-by-byte shift loop with a `memcpy` fast path when the field fits in `T`, which compiles to a couple of loads instead of a runtime-bounded loop.

